1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:04,640
Every day, pieces of us are left behind —

2
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:08,600
in conversations, in unfinished ideas,
in choices whose reasons fade.

3
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:14,000
AI can answer faster than ever.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,510
But speed alone does not preserve
who we are, or what we value.

5
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:25,400
From 초인류기업, this is WEAVRAIN.

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,820
Not another AI assistant.

7
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:33,200
A human-sovereign intelligence system,

8
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,800
connecting your memories, conversations,
decisions, and creative work

9
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,620
into one living second-brain structure.

10
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,600
It begins with the first sentence
only you can write.

11
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,420
You remain the author.

12
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:55,100
From there, WEAVRAIN helps you
recover context, connect meaning,

13
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:59,050
preserve the reasons behind your decisions,
and learn from outcomes.

14
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:05,200
It separates the known, the inferred,
and the merely suggested.

15
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,860
Uncertainty stays visible.
Correction stays in your hands.

16
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:16,200
A Sovereignty Sentinel can surface value conflicts,
memory distortion, or excessive AI authority.

17
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:18,220
It explains. Never overrules.

18
00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:24,200
You control the memory.
You hold the final judgment.

19
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,800
WEAVRAIN.

20
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:29,570
Your memory. Your intelligence.
Your authority.
